id: DRAFT-rapidyaml-0.7.2-cmake4-cmp0037-old-guard
severity: 2
category: toolchain|cmake|conan
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: configuration
approach: version-guard-cmake-policy
keywords: CMP0037, cmake_policy, CMake 4, target name test, c4core, c4Project.cmake, HarmonyOS, OHOS
error_signature: Policy CMP0037 may not be set to OLD behavior because this version of CMake no longer supports it
match_keywords: CMP0037,cmake_policy,OLD behavior,CMake 4,no longer supports
title: CMake >= 4.0 移除 cmake_policy(SET CMP0037 OLD)，需按版本号守卫
root_cause: "CMake 4.x 移除了 CMP0037（target name 'test' 保留字）的 OLD 兼容模式；上游 CMake 辅助模块
  （如 biojppm/c4core 的 cmake/c4Project.cmake）无条件设置 cmake_policy(SET CMP0037 OLD)，在 CMake>=4 下
  configure 阶段直接报错退出。与 E187（cmake_minimum_required <3.5 拒绝，用 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM）
  属同类 CMake4 兼容收紧，但根因和修复不同：E187 是版本下限策略，本条目是策略 OLD 模式被移除，只能
  在源码内按 CMAKE_VERSION 守卫。"
affected_scope: "所有在 CMake>=4.0 工具链下构建、且上游 CMake 辅助模块设置 CMP0037 OLD 的 C/C++ 库
  （c4core 系、rapidyaml、及其他复用 biojppm/cmake 辅助模块的项目）"
verification_cmd: "grep -n 'CMP0037' CMakeLists.txt cmake/ 2>/dev/null; cmake --version"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "if(CMAKE_VERSION VERSION_LESS 4.0) cmake_policy(SET CMP0037 OLD) endif()"
rec_description: "将 cmake_policy(SET CMP0037 OLD) 包在 CMAKE_VERSION 版本守卫内，CMake>=4 时跳过
  （NEW 行为即默认，target 不再叫 test 即可），CMake<4 保持旧行为，无需改动 target 名称。"
rec_command: "patch -p1 < patches/0002-cmake-c4Project-cmp0037.patch"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual-edit
forbid_1_pattern: cmake_policy\(SET CMP0037 (OLD|NEW)\)
forbid_1_reason: 无条件设置 OLD 在 CMake>=4 报错；无条件 NEW 在 CMake<4 改变保留字 target 行为
forbid_1_consequence: 无条件 OLD → CMake 4 下 configure 崩溃；无条件 NEW → 旧 CMake 下 target 名 test 冲突
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: cmake-version-gated-policy-new
fallback_description: 等价方案：if(NOT CMAKE_VERSION VERSION_LESS 4.0) 用 cmake_policy(SET CMP0037 NEW)
  或直接依赖默认行为，把保留字 target 重命名
fallback_command: "sed -i 's/add_custom_target(test)/add_custom_target(ryml-test)/' CMakeLists.txt"
fallback_auto_fix: false
principles: P001, P003
similar_to: E187
caused_by:
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-rapidyaml-0.7.2-cmake4-cmp0037-old-guard.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: "rapidyaml 0.7.2 适配 HarmonyOS PC：c4core v0.2.2 cmake/c4Project.cmake:2872 在 CMake 4.1.2 下
  configure 失败（两次复现）；版本守卫后 conan create 全门禁通过"
